{"unit_id":"Bai-2008__dsh-better-panel#caveat-host-slots","repo":"Bai-2008/dsh-better-panel","commit":"4f798ffcecf17d52cd15aaa617124c21b9784c12","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:123-145"],"text":"dsh-better-panel 使用前须知：自建面板依赖 DSH 的模型目录和输入区模型、右侧及浮层插槽；接管模型插槽后，官方模型菜单入口不再出现。（见 lib/client.js:123-145）"}
